{
  "headline": "Milrinone lactate is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; supply traces to a registered plant with VAI inspections in 2015, 2018, and 2023",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "E7", "E4", "E5", "E6"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include milrinone lactate as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product used at Corvale General and Corvale Lakeside carries NDC 71288020011 and is labeled by Meitheal Pharmaceuticals Inc.",
      "cites": ["E2", "E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The SPL set ID 6c6b69f9-e229-4a93-a108-9eafdab614f0 names Nanjing King-Friend Biochemical Pharmaceutical Co., Ltd. (FEI 3010625707) as a registered manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for that plant show VAI classifications on 2015-05-12, 2018-04-03, and 2023-11-10.",
      "cites": ["E4", "E5", "E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 158 vials of the 1 mg/mL 10 mL presentation, providing 26.3 days of supply at current use.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 13 vials of the same presentation, providing 8 days of supply at current use.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked action is to transfer 10 vials from Corvale General to Corvale Lakeside, which would leave Corvale General with about two weeks of supply and bring Corvale Lakeside to 14 days.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    }
  ]
}
